        },
        {
          "text": "EXECUTIVE BRIEF \u00b7 02",
          "bbox": [
            821.1,
            514.78,
            926.0,
            529.08
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 6186611
        },
        {
          "text": "FACT",
          "bbox": [
            59.0,
            165.28,
            84.35,
            179.58
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-SemiBold",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 16777215
        },
        {
          "text": "Meticulous already speaks directly to teams shipping code with agents, while keeping its public identity",
          "bbox": [
            101.35,
            150.68,
            885.35,
            172.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "anchored on automated, exhaustive and deterministic verification.",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            173.68,
            557.76,
            195.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "[S-M01]",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            200.78,
            89.59,
            215.08
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 6186611
        },
        {
          "text": "FACT",
          "bbox": [
            59.0,
            233.28,
            84.35,
            247.58
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-SemiBold",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 16777215
        },
        {
          "text": "On 5 August, Meticulous announced the Agent-Driven Test Harness (Beta). Current docs describe a",
          "bbox": [
            101.35,
            218.68,
            851.62,
            240.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "closely matching opt-in Agent review workflow that explores a pull request and creates additional",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            241.68,
            793.28,
            263.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "recorded sessions.",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            264.68,
            193.88,
            286.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "[S-M02][S-M03][S-M12]",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            291.78,
            164.77,
            306.08
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 6186611
        },
        {
          "text": "FACT",
          "bbox": [
            59.0,
            324.28,
            84.35,
            338.58
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-SemiBold",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 16777215
        },
        {
          "text": "Two recently updated market guides still describe Meticulous primarily through session-derived testing.",
          "bbox": [
            101.35,
            309.68,
            890.69,
            331.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them separately places products such as Momentic in an \u201cAgentic E2E\u201d category.",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            332.68,
            718.32,
            354.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "[S-X01][S-X02]",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            359.78,
            120.44,
            374.08
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 6186611
        },
        {
          "text": "INFERENCE",
          "bbox": [
            59.0,
            392.28,
            116.21,
            406.58
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-SemiBold",
          "size": 10.5,
          "color": 16777215
        },
        {
          "text": "The useful positioning question is therefore not simply whether Meticulous is agentic. It is whether",
          "bbox": [
            133.21,
            377.68,
            884.64,
            399.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "the company should let that broad category define the product, or keep the stronger distinction on",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            400.68,
            805.02,
            422.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "where coverage originates.",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            423.68,
            258.95,
            445.75
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.2,
          "color": 1515562
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "width": 960.0,
      "height": 540.0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "FINDING 01",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
