          "bbox": [
            101.35,
            150.9,
            873.31,
            172.69
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.0,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "code, and replays them deterministically. Its August Beta adds agent-generated sessions where existing",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            173.9,
            832.19,
            195.69
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.0,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
          "text": "recordings leave gaps.",
          "bbox": [
            52.0,
            196.9,
            221.17,
            218.69
          ],
          "font": "NotoSans-Regular",
          "size": 16.0,
          "color": 1515562
        },
        {
